  "body": "<p>Changing the language in Discord is super easy! This guide will show you how.</p>\n<h2>The Process is simple!</h2>\n<p>Open up your user settings.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/article_attachments/115001054532\" alt=\"U7I9yQm.png\"><br>Check out the \"Language\" tab, and select your language from the options available.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/article_attachments/360058106372\" alt=\"Capture41.jpg\"></p>\n<h3>Simple as that! Now you can enjoy Discord in its many geographical flavors.</h3>",
